  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: Total number of cases ; ${ }^{20} \\mathrm{C}_3=\\frac{20 \\times 19 \\times 18}{2 \\times 3}=20 \\times 19 \\times 3=1140$\nTotal number of favourable cases $=18$\n$\\therefore$ Required probability $=\\frac{18}{1140}=\\frac{3}{190}$",
